OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 JUN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the in best
OL,6,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,7,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,8,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,9,     Gfavourites.
OL,10,G1300FClassical Live
OL,11,     GElizabeth Alker introduces recent
OL,12,     Gconcert performances from the
OL,13,     Glast of our ten featured living
OL,14,     Gconductors, Yannick Nezet-Seguin,
OL,15,     Gin music by Tchaikovsky, Saint-
OL,16,     GSaens and Ravel.
